{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Get the Battle Pass and the Legacy Pass in one bundle. Warriors from all factions have armed themselves with the Y9S3 Battle Bundle. It gives you access to 100 tiers of progression rewards for both Battle Pass and Legacy Pass for all 37 heroes including:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >-Instant unlock of the next 25 tiers in your current progression</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >-2 Executions and Weapon Sets (per hero)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >-1 Paired Emote (per hero)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >-1 Podium (per hero)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >-4 Battle Outfits and Effects (per hero)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >-Various customization elements</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >-A 20% bonus in battle points earned through completed matches</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >-Legacy Pass tier #101 for retrofitted rewards for all heroes released after Y5S3 to date</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >-And more!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The For Honor Y9S3 Battle Bundle is available until December 2, 2025, and is not eligible for refund.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3888000?t=1757596507","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3888000?t=1757596507","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3888000/bfedb933081a083111d448fca898ec2c4b8cff73/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1757596507","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3888000/bfedb933081a083111d448fca898ec2c4b8cff73/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1757596507","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"PvP","id":49},{"description":"Online PvP","id":36},{"description":"Co-op","id":9},{"description":"Online Co-op","id":38},{"description":"Downloadable Content","id":21},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Steam Trading Cards